<title>USA: Sprint unit wins $120 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Sprint unit wins $120 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sprint Mailing Services, a unit of Sprint Corp, said Thursday it won a five-year, $120 million mailing services contract by Sprint PCS, which is a joint venture of Sprint, Tele-Communications Inc, Cox Communications Inc and Comcast Corp.</p>
<p>Sprint Mailing Services is a unit of Sprint's Information Technology Services Division in Rancho Cordova, Calif. It will provide customized mailing services from printing to mailing of Sprint PCS customer invoices.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
